onday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm and 8pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm and 8pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 12:30pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>5 – 11 October 2026</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm and 8pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm and 8pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm and 8pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 1pm</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>12 Oct – 1 November 2026</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm and 8pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm and 8pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 12:30pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>For EG D026 Lulworth Outer, contact Royal Navy for further information.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"notes\">Notes</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Airspace closed for duration as per AIP.</li>\n  <li>Red Range Boundary flags are permanently hoisted in accordance with the Bylaws to provide warning against Unexploded Ordnance (UXO).</li>\n  <li>Red flags located at Range entry points are hoisted when the Ranges are Live Firing and lowered when the Range walks are open.</li>\n  <li>For general information regarding the firing programme on Lulworth Ranges, please phone 01929 404714 (automated).</li>\n  <li>For general information regarding the firing programme on Lulworth Ranges, please phone 0800 0856628 or 01929 404712 during operating hours.</li>\n  <li>Weekend firing is programmed to take place six times per year and includes night firing on Saturdays.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Read more about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/south-west-england-public-access-to-military-areas\">South West England - public access to military areas - GOV.UK </a></p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Firing takes place when roads are marked as ‘Closed’.</li>\n  <li>There is no entry into the out of bounds area, which is completely fenced and appropriately signed.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"contact-us\">Contact us</h3>\n\n<p>For further information on the armed forces’ training at Lulworth Camp  contact:</p>\n\n<div class=\"address\"><div class=\"adr org fn\"><p>\nDIO Lulworth Range Control<br>Lulworth Camp,<br>Wareham,<br>Dorset,<br>BH20 5QF\n</p></div></div>\n\n<p>Email address: <a href=\"DIORDOSTrg-SWLulworthMailbox@mod.gov.uk\">DIORDOSTrg-SWLulworthMailbox@mod.gov.uk</a></p>\n\n<p>Phone: 01929 404712</p>\n</div>","first_published_version":false,"headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"lulworth-range-complex","level":3,"text":"Lulworth Range Complex"},{"id":"your-safety","level":3,"text":"Your safety"},{"id":"site-specific-notes","level":3,"text":"Site specific notes"},{"headers":[{"id":"lulworth-range-walks-access-for-the-following-dates-and-times","level":4,"text":"Lulworth Range Walks access for the following dates and times:"},{"id":"tyneham-church-school-and-village-gate-acces